            server.serve_forever()\\n```\\n\\n### URL Pattern                   
            Examples\\n\\n```python\\nfrom djangoframework import path,         
            re_path\\n\\nurlpatterns = [\\n    # Literal path\\n                
            path(\'about/\', about_view),\\n    \\n    # String parameter\\n    
            path(\'user/<str:username>/\', user_detail),\\n    \\n    # Integer 
